# Implementation Plan: Comprehensive Testing for Monetization & Analytics

This plan outlines the steps to build a robust test suite for the newly implemented Analytics Dashboard, Course Bundles, and Tiered Memberships.

## Proposed Changes

### [Component Name] Admin Analytics Testing

#### [NEW] [AdminAnalyticsTest.php](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Admin/tests/Feature/AdminAnalyticsTest.php)
- Test `GET /api/v1/admin/dashboard/stats` for authorized admin access.
- Test unauthorized access prevention (non-admin users).
- Verify the structure of returned analytics data.

---

### [Component Name] Course Bundles Testing

#### [NEW] [BundleTest.php](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Bundles/tests/Feature/BundleTest.php)
- Test `GET /api/v1/bundles/owned` returns correct data for students.
- Test `POST /api/enrollments/unlock` logic:
    - Should successfully enroll a student if they own a bundle containing the course.
    - Should fail if the student does not own a qualifying bundle.
    - Should fail if the student is already enrolled.

---

### [Component Name] Memberships & Access Logic Testing

#### [NEW] [MembershipTest.php](file:///d:/learning/SkillPilot/skillpilot-backend/Modules/Memberships/tests/Feature/MembershipTest.php)
- Test `GET /api/v1/memberships/status` returns the active subscription.
- Test `CourseAccessService` logic:
    - Verify access granted for direct enrollment.
    - Verify access granted for tiered membership (Level 2 plan accessing Level 1/2 courses).
    - Verify access denied for tiered membership (Level 1 plan accessing Level 2 courses).

---

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run all new tests using PHPUnit:
  - `php artisan test Modules/Admin`
  - `php artisan test Modules/Bundles`
  - `php artisan test Modules/Memberships`
- Verify 100% pass rate.
